      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `79eeb3ecf51a2cdc048b5143f599c6069e1b67cc30e74edf9c171045bde13de1--federal-defendants-australia-2015-16-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Federal Defendants, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015-16\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 088cbb5a41b2197b4fcdaedc9bf0ea8945928c26b1c3685cd2d08479c4d22498 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | e71342242f639d7522f1c2a1228657dd48564d5d03dfd1d54c6d218e7f7f0f8a | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 8a5d178262a720f2923475a7b2084bfb861725f6229cbd8c49255bee5e245620 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 3d54a2ec78752523b45f015a3c935c06442684d698da48d29fcd9906dd06f0dd | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 55c28b231e74acadb5c5d6da8a72126eea57fd6249b1b04062ad328c244071dc | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | edf6cb9604abdc20e9cd10d490bd66890d7dca2e070e9dbed2f59654ca47491f | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | b6d6be117863da307b857682489311278afdcc65ba16228a1ab42a9c6e1e8194 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
